- src/index.ts
  - Adds `valid-req-reference` to the dynamically loaded rules and includes it in the recommended/strict configs with severity `error`, ensuring it participates in normal lint runs.
- docs/config-presets.md
  - Lists `traceability/valid-req-reference` among rules enabled by the recommended and strict presets, showing documented integration into the plugin's configuration surface.

